 "made_by": "parts/make_part.py",
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "vo01",
   "beat": "open",
   "text": "What if Earth spun faster, and couldn't stop?",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "01.wav",
   "dur": 2.32,
   "sha256": "e19e8bc46ddc13ff14427becddfcf20c9affcf7b73a59d37b8b84fc9d6f506d9"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo02",
   "beat": "hook-1",
   "text": "You are standing on the equator, and you are going to watch what happens, minute by minute, until the planet can't take it anymore.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "02.wav",
   "dur": 6.85,
   "sha256": "061ec5f6fbe378da263727f794647f996d2e4408c108cdb9ad2dd01dd7425eff"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo03",
   "beat": "premise-1",
   "text": "Here are the rules.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "03.wav",
   "dur": 0.94,
   "sha256": "9c5d651e68bca1e2bbffce203a989cf0e9faee448a439141f1370cb0aa93aedc"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo04",
   "beat": "premise-2",
   "text": "The Earth keeps its size, its shape, its air and its water.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "04.wav",
   "dur": 3.51,
   "sha256": "5232740f45ca09b7b88c4526e168118a34d3449b83282b48475d99f7bf14e9a6"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo05",
   "beat": "premise-3",
   "text": "Only the spin changes, and it only ever gets faster.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "05.wav",
   "dur": 3.05,
   "sha256": "c1574a0f64d3596bb861477c2d08f0a5206c88991c458a3322f98c0a1de33d2b"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo06",
   "beat": "premise-4",
   "text": "On screen there is one number that matters: the length of a day.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "06.wav",
   "dur": 4.02,
   "sha256": "717ae068d1dd20ca0de05c663d205543037f2f83cd7fb5730ed0acd0314ecb47"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo07",
   "beat": "premise-5",
   "text": "It starts at twenty-four hours, and by the end it will have fallen to about an hour and twenty-four minutes.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "07.wav",
   "dur": 5.21,
   "sha256": "692e0409a24a3dc22bfff1a6311423613b509bec2d13f12f482da76a8c0fcadc"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo08",
   "beat": "today-1",
   "text": "Right now, one day lasts twenty-four hours.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "08.wav",
   "dur": 2.85,
   "sha256": "24f93cbf362012116ebd6b69b3f261c66555f0b402f2db5ae767afac6f5ef453"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo09",
   "beat": "today-2",
   "text": "Standing on the equator, the ground carries you around at about sixteen hundred and seventy kilometers an hour.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "09.wav",
   "dur": 6.805,
   "sha256": "27e5ee85e65882034a48853fb1651c8ea440de52609b941c41a621323062197c"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo10",
   "beat": "today-3",
   "text": "You never feel it, because everything moves with you.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "10.wav",
   "dur": 1.84,
   "sha256": "b7298a2ff205565887fbaebf22e8a7dca94ea8cec53d55e7f2b691409f55240c"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo11",
   "beat": "today-4",
   "text": "What you do feel is a tiny push outward.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "11.wav",
   "dur": 1.325,
   "sha256": "6bb505d1b5c8f9b4e5bd79760e0cbfa8d1a349bca5aab854a64e33d0420f6516"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo12",
   "beat": "today-5",
   "text": "You weigh about a third of a percent less than you would on a planet that did not spin.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "12.wav",
   "dur": 3.78,
   "sha256": "36d8113932cf07f6e48d8157e46c3f1377af8cc02af20ef5c017d6f958aa3879"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo13",
   "beat": "spinup-1",
   "text": "Now the spin begins to speed up.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "13.wav",
   "dur": 2.05,
   "sha256": "eb6648cd914961998cb2421b9208ce74f7f384202d2c6b40631cfd19568a0129"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo14",
   "beat": "spinup-2",
   "text": "At twenty hours, you can see the shadows sweep.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "14.wav",
   "dur": 2.15,
   "sha256": "f29a5a219157cb53551296b864c28e9e8af9796fd61eb79a96c03f0e2c3eec5e"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo15",
   "beat": "spinup-3",
   "text": "At sixteen, the Sun climbs the sky like a slow elevator.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "15.wav",
   "dur": 3.295,
   "sha256": "ace30cec5bc9598f395795baa163f3a87e5704159869886254ca88cb56533d81"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo16",
   "beat": "cta",
   "text": "Hang on. If you're enjoying this, tap like and follow. Okay, back to the math.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "16.wav",
   "dur": 4.03,
   "sha256": "5ed901cc5a87bb8e232cd6275c084613b3a298c16aa12569c84f30098ae01bba"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo17",
   "beat": "spinup-4",
   "text": "The rule never changes.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "17.wav",
   "dur": 1.69,
   "sha256": "06420b8299c4da4a9420174a2347497153b6ff33edad4778e5db4041380135b5"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo18",
   "beat": "spinup-5",
   "text": "A day only ever gets shorter, and you cannot turn it back.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "18.wav",
   "dur": 2.92,
   "sha256": "74d5de7809be6e0f2f5b07242d0dc3bada21e67aecd27a02937102df658c7d3e"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo19",
   "beat": "cliff",
   "text": "And the spin has only just begun to speed up.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "19.wav",
   "dur": 2.26,
   "sha256": "3aca2ed631afdab829ada5716dd46290696656e5f0bf8eaa6377565c2cc2f7dd"
  },
  {
